          <rules>
            <rule id="39ef-c4d0-439a-b7d8" name="Archaeotechnological Marvel" page="60" hidden="false">
              <description>You may only include one of these models in your army for games of 2000 points or more where the detachment also includes an Archmagos Prime. If the Archmagos Prime has selected the Reductor High Order of Techno-Arcana, you may include two of these models in your army instead of one in games of 2000 points or more.</description>
            </rule>
