                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">For the duration of the first Game Turn, all Shooting Attacks made against a model with an Ordinatus dispersion shield that target the model’s Front or Side Armour values, or any indirect Shooting Attacks (such as those with the Barrage special rule) are reduced by -2 Strength, and any Explodes results on the Vehicle Damage table are ignored.

In subsequent Game Turns after the first, the Ordinatus Dispersion Shield counts as a Flare Shield</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
          </costs>
